                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f773b131-c645-4dc3-a70b-a331a2156a0d",
                                "sense_id": "e3455e4e-bc37-3901-8efc-d2bee5f99314",
                                "text": "In contrast, a water-repellent substance, for example, fluoric resin or Teflon, is extremely nonaffinitive with the oily oxime hydrochlorides and has a nature to repel it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "49bda0f5-3cf6-47c3-bec5-569fcf940510",
                                "sense_id": "e3455e4e-bc37-3901-8efc-d2bee5f99314",
                                "text": "the social division of labor here is imposed on individuals as an elemental force, and under these conditions it is precisely \"nonaffinitive,\" alienated labor that is the dominant form."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d868edc-70ad-41a0-b08d-eddec8b1d4e1",
                                "sense_id": "e3455e4e-bc37-3901-8efc-d2bee5f99314",
                                "text": "A first sign of international interest from nonaffinitive circles came from Berlin."
